  "Question": "Let \\(ABCD\\) be a unit square. Let \\(Q_1\\) be the midpoint of \\(\\overline{CD}.\\) For \\(i=1,\\) \\(2,\\) \\(\\ldots,\\) let \\(P_i\\) be the intersection of \\(\\overline{AQ_i}\\) and \\(\\overline{BD},\\) and let \\(Q_{i+1}\\) be the foot of the perpendicular from \\(P_i\\) to \\(\\overline{CD}.\\) What is\n\n\\[ \\sum_{i=1}^{\\infty}\\text{Area of }\\triangle DQ_iP_i? \\]",
